Cell["\<\
A codimension-one HR is called an exact boundary restriction of an interior \
HR only when, after setting the contracted LP parameter to zero, the active \
pullback scaling, exact cancellation ideal and W_HR agree. W_SL is not used \
because it labels the Part-I/alignment presentation. There are 6 such \
boundary HRs, distributed as <|x7 -> 3, x2 -> 3|>; 6 boundary HRs have no \
interior extension within this topology sample.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0a7af872-9e91-4a1a-a343-051f696950ed"],

